# Commands run through $SMOKEPOD_TARGET, which smokepod sets to the --target
# binary, so this one test file grades any candidate against the baseline.
## greet
$ "$SMOKEPOD_TARGET" greet world
hello, world

## version
$ "$SMOKEPOD_TARGET" version
app 1.0

## usage
$ "$SMOKEPOD_TARGET" nope
usage: app.sh greet|version [name]
[exit:1]
